{# A place, as a stack of blocks with a rail beside them.

   Cities today, countries beside them, and an airline or an airport next. All
   of them read the same way: a page you arrive at cold from a search engine,
   four or five things you might want, and a rail to jump between them. The
   shell is here so that shape is stated once.

   What each page brings is its own `blocks` list -- and the list is the rail as
   well as the content, so an anchor and the section it points at cannot drift
   apart. `when` is what drops a block: Honolulu has no city within a thousand
   miles, and a heading over an empty list is worse than no heading.

   `data` is handed to every block whole and each takes what it needs. Passed
   `only`, so a block cannot quietly come to depend on something the page
   happened to have in scope. #}
<main role="main" class="place">
    <div class="container place__layout">

        {# Sticky, and bounded by the layout it sits in: it follows the blocks
           down and stops with them rather than riding over the footer. #}
        <nav class="place__rail" aria-labelledby="place-rail-title">
            <p class="place__rail-title" id="place-rail-title">{{ rail_title }}</p>
            <ul class="place__rail-list">
                {% for block in blocks %}
                    {% if block.when %}
                        <li>
                            <a class="place__rail-link" href="#{{ block.id }}">
                                <span class="place__rail-icon place__rail-icon--{{ block.tone }}">
                                    <i class="fas {{ block.icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                </span>
                                {{ block.nav }}
                            </a>
                        </li>
                    {% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </nav>

        <div class="place__blocks">
            <h1 class="visually-hidden">{{ heading }}</h1>

            {% for block in blocks %}
                {% if block.when %}
                    <section class="place__block" id="{{ block.id }}" aria-labelledby="{{ block.id }}-title">
                        <h2 class="place__block-title" id="{{ block.id }}-title">{{ block.title }}</h2>
                        {% include block.template with data only %}
                    </section>
                {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</main>
